<title>INDIA: India United Phos 96/97 1st hlf net down.</title>
<headline>India United Phos 96/97 1st hlf net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	 185.3   vs    260.8</p>
<p>    Sales	    2,948.6   vs  2,262.8</p>
<p>    Expenditure    2,524.6   vs  1,946.4</p>
<p>    Gross profit     476.7   vs    351.2</p>
<p>    Interest	   221.8   vs     42.2</p>
<p>    Depreciation	69.5   vs     48.2</p>
<p>    Taxation	    Nil    vs	Nil</p>
<p>Note: United Phosphorus is India's leading producer of phosphorous-based agrochemicals. The results are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
